window.products.push({"id":640045,"name":"Le Tonnelier Sommelier Waiter Wine Corkscrew with Hinged Fulcrum, Foil Cutter and Bottle Cap Opener; Stainless Steel Construction with Inlaid Wood Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jmG35aSWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOMMELIER'S DREAM - The durable stainless steel craftmanship of this corkscrew make it a dependable corkscrew opener for a Sommelier. The precision turn ratio of the coils and the non-stick coating we applied makes our corkscrew perform effortlessly. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL TOOL - The LE TONNELIER Sommelier Wine corkscrew has many functions. There is the double hinged fulcrum for two step uncorking of wine, a serrated foil cutter knife that can be folded away for safety and a bottle cap opener for capped bottles such as beer or soda. The end of the fulcrum can also be used to lift tabs on canned drinks. QUALITY IN DESIGN - Stainless steel construction ensures no rusting. Precision turn ratio on spiral coils ensures straight insertion with no damage to cork when using the double fulcrum two step process. Smooth finish on inlaid wood handle steps up the look and feel of our corkscrew. GREAT GIFT - Our exquiste box with the LE TONNELIER logo makes this a gift worth giving! It is almost too beautiful to wrap so we won't blame you if you don't! Magnetic flab closure, velvety padding that encapsulates and cradles the corkscrew keeps it from being damaged during delivery. ABOUT LE TONNELIER: Cooperage (German) is the art of barrel making and the French translation is \"Le Tonnelier\". From the fire that toasts the wood, to a cooper examining the grain, to the ageing of the staves in the rain and the wind, to an oak tree growing straight in a French forest; how a wine will taste is all predicated on the barrels that a winemaker chooses. Trust the barrel maker - choose LE TONNELIER.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jmG35aSWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Tonnelier","source_asin":"B07T4GPFMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T4GPFMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T4GPFMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
