window.products.push({"id":640136,"name":"CrystalTears Crystal Gemstone Tree Amethyst Rose Quartz Aquamarine Crystal Money Tree Feng Shui Crystal Bonsai Tree for Good Luck Home Decoration 5.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eR5krAD4L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Handmade Natural Crystal Money Tree Feng Shui Crystal Tree Sculpture Figurine Healing Gemstone Tree Of Life Ornament with Agate Slice Geode Stand for Healing Good Luck Home Office Decoration Christmas Gift Crystal Tree Deatails: Size: Total height: 5.5\"-6.3\"/14-16cm; agalte slice stand: 2.76\"-3.54\"/7-9cm in length and width, 4.5-8mm in thickness.Material£ºnatural amethyst, rose quartz, aquamarine, agate slice geode stand, high quality copperWeight: 120-180g.Package: 1x crystal tree; 1x gift box Crystal Money Tree(Feng Shui Crystal Tree): The Chinese Letter on the Money Tree is \" Choi\" means \"Wealth\" \"Luck. It is also known as\"Feng Shui Tree\" and \"Wishing Tree, which can bring money and fortune. This is also a energy crystal decoration to enhance healing energies and focus energies in positive ways. .It is great for your personal altar, crystal healing,meditation,communication. Tree Of Life: Cystal Tree also known as \"tree of life\", it symbolizes family through its intricate network of branches, showing us the continuity through all generations.Exquiste Gift Choice: The semi precious gemstone bonsai tree ornament is perfect for home/indoor/outdoor/garden/living room/office decoration. It is a great choice as exquisite gift for your elders, families, friends,business partners, gemstone collector on Birthday, Valentine's day , Anniversary, Christmas, Thanksgiving day to sending your best wishes. Please Note: 1)The money tree branch and leaves are folded for a safer transport, you need to arrange the copper wire and the crystal stone with using your creativity to make a beautiful artwork. 2)If you have any question or problem about your crystal bonsai tree purchased, please contact with us, you will get a reply within 24 hours. We provide 90 days money back guarantee.3) Due to the nature of gemstone and it is handmade item, tree may slightly vary in size, color and shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eR5krAD4L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalTears","source_asin":"B07SPRYNPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SPRYNPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SPRYNPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
