window.products.push({"id":640204,"name":"1PCs 760ML Chinese Purple Clay Dragon Tea Pot Kettle Zisha Kung Fu Teapot Large Capacity-Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6189Ub2-0lL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"Tips:Before you drinking the first time, clean up the stains in the teapot using pure water, and wipe the teapot with a clean cloth, and waiting to dry naturally. Then put it into clean water and let it boil for 5-10 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6189Ub2-0lL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"zoele","source_asin":"B06XK9R3XN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XK9R3XN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XK9R3XN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":640205,"name":"Yakun Dream Catchers for Bedroom Dream Catcher Handmade Traditional Dream Net Rainbow Feather Colorful Wall Hanging Ornament Home Decor Craft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612n3dQ5yhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"An Ancient Legend: In some Native American cultures, a dreamcatcher is a handmade willow hoop, on which is woven a net or web. The dream catcher may also include sacred items such as certain feathers or beads. Traditionally they are often hung over cradles as protection, a hoop with woven string or sinew meant to replicate a spider's web, used as a protective charm for infants. Native Americans believes the air is filled with both good and bad dreams. Dream catchers are hung in the tepee or lodge. The good dreams pass through the dream catcher to the sleeping person. The bad dreams are trapped in the web where they perish in the light dawn. Features: 1.Every process is a manual stitch that takes more than 10 years of weaving experience. Skilled workers can weave such a uniform, perfect and rhythmic mesh. 2.High quality beads, with color paint, the pendant is bright, shiny, smooth and transparent. 3.Feathers are specially treated and carefully selected to ensure that each feather is flawless and trimmed by the skilled workers.It is the demanding requirements that define the exceptional quality. Specification: 1.Material: Iron Ring + Feather + wooden beads. 2.Dia of Circle: 7.9 inch; Total length: about 23.6 Inch. 3.Color: rainbow. 4.Weight: about 0.14lb. Package Includes: 1 x Dreamcatcher Note: 1. Our dream catchers are pure handmade, so it is very normal if there is a little difference between each one. 2. Due to the light and screen difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures. 3. Please allow 1-2cm differences due to manual measurement. Guarantee: If you have any further questions, please feel free to contact us. We will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612n3dQ5yhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kxuhivc","source_asin":"B07KRSBF4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KRSBF4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KRSBF4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":640206,"name":"Big Dot of Happiness Jolly Santa Claus - Christmas Party Decorations for Women and Men - 6 Beer Bottle Label Stickers and 1 Carrier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P2hvL8sqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Jolly Santa Claus Beer Gift Set INCLUDES 6 beer bottle sticker labels & 6 bottle neck labels in the Santa theme, as well as 1 six-pack carrier with 4 Ho Ho Ho Hoppy Holidays stickers for decoration. Christmas Beer bottle stickers each SIZE 3.5\" wide x 3\" tall, perfect for standard beer bottles or similarly sized soda bottles; Beer collar neck labels measure 3.5\" long x 1.5\" wide at the center. Beer bottle labels are quick to apply and will give your Jolly Santa Claus gift a personal touch! HIGH QUALITY PARTY SUPPLIES: Jolly Santa Claus beer bottle labels are professionally printed on a sticker paper with a glossy coating. They are waterproof and can be used on bottles that will be chilled, just apply prior to chilling. Use the beer kit as the perfect Christmas or holiday gift or at a party beverage bar for an impressive, coordinated display. EASY TO USE: Prepare your beverage bottles by ensuring they are room temperature. Removing the original bottle label is not necessary but is preferred. Carefully peel one Santa Claus sticker label from the backing and adhere to a bottle, starting at the edge and rolling to the opposite edge. Add the bottle neck label and place the completed bottle into the kraft paper carrier. Complete the party beer gift kit by adding the remaining 4 stickers to the sides of the six-pack carrier. MADE IN THE USA: Jolly Santa Claus - Christmas Party Beer Bottle Labels and Carrier is designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA. Please Note: Beer in image is not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P2hvL8sqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B0163D2LAY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0163D2LAY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0163D2LAY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":640207,"name":"Tojiro Kitchen Knife F-807","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":92.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kFuCnZKsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Tojiro DP knives are made in the 'honwarikomi' method where a carbon steel plate is encased front, top, and back in stain-resistant steel. As a result, the cutting edge of the blade is as sharp and durable as a carbon steel knife, while the stain-resistant steel outer layer makes this knife very easy to maintain.Tojiro's honwarikomi knives use high-quality Swedish carbon steel and 13% chromium stain-resistant steel in their construction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kFuCnZKsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOJIRO","source_asin":"B000UAQOU0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000UAQOU0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000UAQOU0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
