window.products.push({"id":640365,"name":"Heat Resistant Air Fryer Mat, 4PCS Kitchen Countertop Heat Protector Mat, Non Slip Appliance Slider Aid Pad for Air Fryer, Coffee Maker, Blender,Toast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819BvyG9QML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👩‍🍳【Kitchen Countertop Heat Resistant Mats】: Our air fryer heat resistant mats are great for blocking heat transfer through the air fryer bottom to the kitchen marble countertop, When the air fryer is in working mode, it generates heat, all of which is transferred through the exposed bottom of the air fryer to the kitchen countertop, preventing granite or marble countertops from cracking due to overheating, and prevent damage and scratches. 👩‍🍳【Kitchen Heat Resistant Air Fryer Mats】: Kitchen Counter appliance slider mats help you easily move small appliances from storage corners to the edge of your operation, such as microwave, coffee makers, Ninja air fryers, mixers, bread makers, and other small kitchen appliances.Kitchen countertop heat protector mats are especially suitable for marble or tile kitchen counters. 👩‍🍳【Kitchen Appliance Heat Resistant Mats】: The 4mm thick kitchen countertop protective mats is made of high-quality heat-resistant felt material, which can effectively resist high temperature and protect your counter from scratches, and the back is silicone particles to ensure the stability and slip resistance of the machine,It can be convenient for your cooking food. 👩‍🍳【Kitchen Counter Appliance Sliders Pad】: Compared to manual appliance sliding trays, this kitchen appliance heat resistant mats is more flexible and practical, the large size of 17.3 x 11.8'' x 0.16'' is large enough to hold all kinds of small appliances. Kitchen appliance sliders mats bring convenience to your life and are a must-have accessory for kitchen countertops. 👩‍🍳【After-Sales Guarantee】: Thank you for purchasing our multifunctional kitchen countertop protector heat resistant mats. If you have any product questions, please feel free to contact us, we will reply you within 24 hours and provide you with the best solution to ensure you have a good shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819BvyG9QML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USDGTKN","source_asin":"B0BNNB1SJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNNB1SJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNNB1SJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":640366,"name":"Lomonosov Porcelain Figurine Gray Sweet Chinchilla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317DKCjJjqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the world of Lomonosov Russian Porcelain !  The Imperial Russian Lomonosov Porcelain Manufactory was founded by Empress Elizabeth, Peter the Great's daughter, in 1744. Here the gifted Russian scientist Dmitry Vinogradov independently discovered the secret of making Russian porcelain and developed the technology for its manufacture and the later creation of Lomonosov Russia.  Three hundred years ago no one in Europe had any idea of the materials and techniques used in making porcelain. The Chinese kept the secrets of porcelain production. Only in the early 18th century in Saxony the alchemist Johan F. Bottger discovered a way to produce \"European\" hard paste porcelain. These developments did not escape the notice of Peter I. During his frequent visits to European countries, Peter I pursued his interest in the secrets of porcelain manufacture and he attempted to introduce it to Russia with the help of foreigners, but unsuccessfully. Peter I's idea to establish his own porcelain production was brought to life two decades later by his daughter, who was then Empress Elizabeth (1741-1761).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317DKCjJjqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lomonosov Russia","source_asin":"B019MPZ77Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019MPZ77Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019MPZ77Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":640367,"name":"Juicer Machine, SiFENE 3.2\" Big Mouth Centrifugal Juicer Extractor Maker with 1300W(Peak) Motor, Juice Squeezer for Whole Fruits and Vegetables, Easy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":118.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HWF-XNtyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Shorten Prep Time with Extra Wide Chute】3.2 inch wide feed chute to accommodate whole fruits and vegetables for minimal prep, not only save time but also make it more convenient. The juicer is designed for efficiency and convenience, last much longer than other competitor, so you can enjoy fresh, homemade juice every day. 【Juicing Faster with Upgraded 1000W Motor】 The juicer machine with high-speed powerful motor, which can reach 1300W(peak) and juices fruit and vegetable faster(within 6 secs) and with more vitamins and better taste than a traditional one. The juicer extracts up to 30% more juice with 40% more vitamins from your favorite fruits and vegetables. 【High Juice Yield with Dry Pulp】 The SiFENE centrifugal juicer Pro equipped a powerful motor with 1300W watts(peak), extracting a big cup of juice just in seconds and the juice yield is up to 85%, which is higher 25% than other centrifugal juicers and juice extractors. After juicing , you can feel the pulp is dry enough with less waste. 【Better taste with Less Pomace】Sifene juicer machine pro with cold extraction technology and germany-made stainless steel mesh filter, allows you to get purer taste juice, cold extraction means less damage to the vitamins and other nutricents during processing. 【Safety Design and Easy to Clean】Our Juicer Extractor is designed for safety and ease of cleaning. It only operates when the cover is securely locked and features a unique overload protection system that automatically shuts down the motor for 2 minutes to prevent overheating, ensuring long-lasting performance. All removable parts are dishwasher-safe for simple, stress-free cleaning. 【Warranty】Motor: 4-year warranty; Normal accessories:2-year warranty; With lifelong technical support and 24/7 customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HWF-XNtyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIFENE","source_asin":"B0C3TT7N2B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3TT7N2B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3TT7N2B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
