window.products.push({"id":640435,"name":"Sheffield Home Protective Decorative Cork Backed Placemats (Set of 4) Christmas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Jbyocc5FL._AC_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of Parisian spirit to any casual tabletop with this 4 piece set of cork backed placemats from Sheffield Home. The Sheffield Home Cork Backed Placemats (Set of 4) Paris Collage includes 4 placemats made from sealed hard board material and features a cork backed design that provides a scratch free and safe way to set a tabletop. Each placemat is decorated with a Parisian collage that depicts the Eiffel Tower, Parisian street signs, and a collection of vintage postcards. A glossy finish adds a level of elegance to the overall look that makes these placemats perfect for use on any indoor or outdoor tabletop. These placemats not only add beauty to a table, but protect your dining table from water marks, stains, and heat damage that can be done from warm plates and serving dishes. The mats are designed for heat resistance up to 303 degrees Fahrenheit and won’t be damaged by heat marks the way that traditional vinyl placemats often are. The rustic and casual design sets the stage for a charming, rustic table top design and can be used beneath dishes of any color or pattern. For a truly vintage inspired table top, create place settings with different dish patterns and colors and arrange a centerpiece full of decorative candleholders and fresh flowers in antique vases. This set of placemats evokes the spirit and the feeling of a cozy French bistro or a sweet smelling patisserie and brings casual elegance into any kitchen or dining room. The classic rectangular design fits easily under standard sized place settings and adds a splash of color to any wooden table top. The slim shape makes it easy to store these placemats in any kitchen or dining room drawer and takes up minimal storage space in between uses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Jbyocc5FL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sheffield Home","source_asin":"B00SHXNHQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SHXNHQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SHXNHQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
