window.products.push({"id":640606,"name":"Fridge Applicable Stainless Steel Magnetic Knife Holder with Anti-Slide Upgrade - 12 Inch Professional Double Sided Knife Strip for Refrigerator - Kni","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s9QbSFpPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑️🧲 FRIDGE MAGNET KNIFE HOLDER – This *NEW, UPGRADED* 12\" stainless steel knife bar, is *DOUBLE SIDED* with heavy-duty magnets on both sides, which can either be attached to the wall *WITHOUT ANY INSTALLATION*. This update provides you with a high quality magnetic knife holder that holds your entire knife set securely and in easy reach on the side of your refrigerator or any other steel surface in your kitchen. ☑️ ANTI-SLIDE AND ANTI-SCRATCH FEATURES - Our 12\" magnetic knife holder for refrigerator is reinforced with special anti-slide patches. Sometimes fridges are not completely flat or have bumps/dents which might cause the knife bar to slide as it's not in direct contact with your fridge. This new upgrade combined with the powerful magnets will prevent that from happening, keeping the knife bar secured. Another bonus is that this upgrade will also leave your fridge scratch free! ☑️🔪 SECURE ANY TYPE OF KNIFE - This magnetic knife strip is designed specifically to hold *ANY SET OF KNIVES* firmly, without slipping or shifting - not even a hint of a wobble! Our magnetic bar is calibrated to securely hold knives of many weights with ease. We are happy to provide worry free, safe storage for Chef's knives, Butcher knives, Cleavers, Bread knives, Carving knives and ANY other Kitchen knife - from the largest, heaviest of your knives to the smallest and skinniest one. ☑️ SIMPLE & ELEGANT MODERN DESIGN – Our knife holder is made from high quality stainless steel and designed with a sleek, elegant appearance. The flat, space-saving magnetic bar has a modern design that fits into *ANY KITCHEN STYLE*. The bar is designed to “float” on the side of your fridge OR on your wall, hiding the magnets & mounting screws. The design of our bar and the *SIMPLE INSTALLATION* allows your knives and stainless steel appliance storage to become a part of your kitchen décor! ☑️ EMPTY YOUR KITCHEN COUNTER & DRAWERS! – HMmagnets 12\" magnetic knife strip for refrigerator helps you get rid of your old bulky knife block which takes up precious counter space. Our magnetic knife strip also helps you *KEEP YOUR KNIVES OFF THE COUNTER* and prevents the trouble of an overflowing drawer. All your knives will be visible and within reach - easily grab the proper knife and get to cooking! Magnetic mount and *no drilling needed!*","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s9QbSFpPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HMmagnets","source_asin":"B0B7VTNGGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7VTNGGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7VTNGGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
