window.products.push({"id":640620,"name":"Fanisic Handheld Vacuum Cleaner, 9500PA Cordless Car Vacuum, Rechargeable Mini Hand Vacuum & Detachable LED Flashlight 2 in 1, Lightweight Vacuum Clea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A58N6VDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝐃𝐞𝐭𝐚𝐜𝐡𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐢𝐧𝐠 & 𝐅𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐥𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭:The handheld vacuum cleaner is designed with a detachable handle, which can be removed by pressing the button. Use the included Type-A to C cable to connect the Type-C port at the handle and a Type-A port to charge easily. The separate handle is also a flashlight. Press the power button for 5 seconds to turn ON the LED emergency lighting, and then turn OFF the flashlight by press the power button for 5s. 𝟐 𝐕𝐚𝐜𝐮𝐮𝐦 𝐍𝐨𝐳𝐳𝐥𝐞𝐬: The keyboard vacuum cleaner has two interchangeable nozzles: Flat nozzle for cleaning debris on flat areas such as desktops; Long brush nozzle for cleaning rough surfaces such as keyboards and car dashboards. So it can be conveniently used in your car, bedroom, office, and anywhere you need it. 𝐏𝐨𝐰𝐞𝐫𝐟𝐮𝐥 𝐒𝐮𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧:The portable vacuum cleaner has a powerful motor with super suction, and can easily suck up dust, paper scraps, cigarette ash, crumbs, etc. Side vents can help dissipate heat and enhance suction. (Note: Please place the suction head close to a flat surface for greater suction.) 𝐖𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 & 𝐃𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐅𝐢𝐥𝐭𝐞𝐫: The high-quality filter in the vacuum cleaner can be washed with running water. If the dust collection cup is visually full, please remove and clean the filter in time to keep the hand-held vacuum cleaner working properly. And please make sure the filter is dry and properly installed before turning on the vacuum cleaner. 𝐋𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐰𝐞𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭 & 𝐂𝐨𝐫𝐝𝐥𝐞𝐬𝐬: The portable cordless vacuum is small and weighs only 350g, can be carried anywhere easily. And it won't feel tiring to use with one hand. 2.5 hours to fully charge and it can be used for 20 minutes. Please fully charge it before using it for the first time. (Note: Type-A to C Cable included, but without adapter)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A58N6VDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fanisic","source_asin":"B09C8CXLJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C8CXLJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C8CXLJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
