window.products.push({"id":640698,"name":"Ziplock Bag Organizer, 6-in-1, Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer, Organization and Storage for Kitchen Drawer, Compatible with All Brands and Sizes Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Q6c03-EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Bamboo 🌷【Make Your Drawer More Neat】：If you have various sizes boxes of food storage bags in your kitchen drawer, you might be hard to find out the right one you need, or if the paper boxes are damaged, it will be not easy to take out bags or cut plastic wrap. So it's necessary to have a ziplock bag organizer to make your drawer more neat and let your life more easy. 🌷【100% Renewable Material】：If you use to store food-contact bags, plastic wrap, foil, be sure to choose an organizer made of pure natural materials instead of a plastic acrylic one that is applied with a lot of glue and has a pungent smell. Our product is made of A+ grade bamboo, which is healthy and sturdy. The multi-polished surface is so smooth that it won't scratch your hands or drawers. 🌷【6-IN-1 Creative Design】：This product contains 4 ziplock bag container ＆ 2 wrap/foil dispensers with cutters. It'll help keep your drawer neat and always within reach. You can put it in the kitchen drawer, we also provide screw accessories to help hanging organizer on the wall. It is also very easy to clean and maintain,just wipe clean with wet cloth. Besides, we adopt laser engraves lables rather than sticker lables that are easy to peel off, which is making product looks more exquisite. 🌷【The Best Organizer in Your Kitchen】：The organizer is one-piece and can be used directly without assembly, convenient to use. It is also very easy to clean and maintain,just wipe clean with wet cloth. Besides, we adopt laser engraves lables rather than sticker lables that are easy to peel off, which is making product looks more exquisite. So it is the best assistant in your kitchen and also the best housewarming gift for your friends. 🌷【Warm Tips】：① Please kindly measure you drawer's size before buying this product in order to avoid it will too big or small to your drawer. If it is too big to your drawer, you also can use the screw accessories or adhesive hooks to mount on the wall. ② When you cut wraps or foil, it's better that slide the blade from left to right, it will be more smooth.③The wrap dispensers are compatible with rolls up to 13\"(not for foil rolls over 13inch x 250FT nor plastic wrap over 13inch x 328FT).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Q6c03-EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIEWSHINE","source_asin":"B09ZXNPCDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZXNPCDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZXNPCDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
