window.products.push({"id":640856,"name":"Rocking Chair Nursery Glider with Ottoman, Mid Century Lounge Chair , Vintage Leather Comfy Accent Chair for Living Room, Reading , Zero Gravity, Side","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713F8FXoC-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ ROCKING CHAIR ]: Aesthetically design living room chairs, mid century modern rocking chair with ottoman. Glossy wooden frame combine with high density and resilience sponge, waterproof Leathaire. Rocking chair with lumbar pillow, side pocket, Anti-slip felt strip. Perfectly match your living room, reading room, nursery room, bedroom. This rocking chair can make you feel totally immersed in it. Sink into this beautiful rocking chair, and you’ll find yourself instantly feeling more relaxed. [ EASY ASSEMBLY ]: This Rocking chair can be assembled by one person within 15 minutes without other tools. Please lay out a rug before assembly to avoid soiling the chair during installation, please install the bolts to 50% first in order to adjust all the hole locations, then install them to 100%. Accent wooden rocking chair made of heavy duty wooden frame can hold to 400 lbs. The rocking chair and ottoman features a sleek, geometric wood frame treated and reinforced to prevent warping. [ COMFORTABLE CHAIR ]: This elegant, eye-catching comfy rocking chair was designed to deliver peak comfort. Thick chemical-free and flame retardant foam cushions provide ample support. 28kg/m3 high density and resilience sponge of seat offers you the comfort of sitting on a cloud. Waterproof leathaire is stain-resistant, durable and breathable. The rocking chair and ottoman with 30-degree tilt angle offers rocking fun, you can put your feet on the footrest to experience zero gravity comfort. [ OCCATIONS ]: Rocking chairs are versatile pieces of furniture that can be used everywhere from the front porch to the bedroom, living room, nursery, reading room, office, studio etc. It can match your space's color palette and lifestyle. Comfy rocking chair with side pocket is convenient for you to put books, mobile phones, remote controls etc. The lumbar pillow offers you better support for your waist. The anti-slip felt strip provides slip resistance while reducing the sound of rocking. Dimensions and Service:Overall size: 33.3\" x 30.3\" x 34.7\" Excellent customer service frees you from worrying about missing parts and damaged parts. Any question please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713F8FXoC-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zugoni","source_asin":"B0BQL9CWSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQL9CWSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQL9CWSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
