window.products.push({"id":640945,"name":"HEWEGO Large Clear Glass Vase,Balloon Glass Jug Vases for Farmhouse,Tabletop Centerpiece Decorative,Tall Floor Vase for Bedroom/Office/Living Room/Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618dLuZlE2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌺【CHARMING JUG VASES】- These large glass vases are used for decoration and have wonderful curved shape. Each large transparent vase is made of very thick glass with natural curves and almost transparent color. Each large clear balloon vase features a wide base and narrow neck creating a striking silhouette that is sure to liven up any interior. 🌺【EASY FLOWER ARRANGEMENT】- Opening fits 5-6 flower stems. Our clear tall glass vases only need a few flowers, making flower arrangements easy and fun. You can also fill them with eucalyptus, artificial flowers, dried or fresh flowers, long olive branches, pampas grass, and hyenas. You can even make beautiful moss terrariums with this clear round glass vase. 🌺【VARIOUS DECOR&PERFECT GIFT】- As a clear glass vase with interesting and unique face art shape, not only a vase and fish tank, but also can be used as living room, dining room, bedroom, window, wall, staircase, indoor and outdoor decoration . The simple and elegant design blends perfectly with your room and venue. It is also a great gift for weddings, housewarmings and all special events. 🌺【PRODUCT INFORMATION】- You will receive a unique round pot-bellied vase, which is beautifully made and perfectly matched with your home decoration. Round jug vase size: 10.5x4x30.5cm/4.1x1.57x12in.As it is a handmade vase, there may be deviations. This transparent vase is very suitable for all kinds of flowers. 🌺【FRIENDLY SERVICE】Package include 1 round glass vase ( not included flowers). Each clear vase is carefully inspected and shipped in product&packaging intact. When you receive our tall vase set, please inspect it carefully. If there is any damage, we will provide 100% refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618dLuZlE2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hewego","source_asin":"B0BNH69XW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNH69XW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNH69XW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":640946,"name":"BedStory Queen Folding Mattress with Carry Bag, Portable Mattress for Camping, Traveling, Multifunction Tri Folding Floor Mattress with Cover, 4 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zgL496b1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIPURPOSE FOLDING MATTRESS - This foldable mattress consists of three separate pads, you can split it and use them individually or in combination.It's comfortable and will be used as an extra sleeping spot for guests or a comfortable floor lounger for movie or game nights, also can be used as a play or exercise mat to keep kids safe on hard floors.After using, fold the mattress and put it into the carry bag to keep the mattress neat. It can be stored in the trunk of your car or under the bed. GREAT PORTABLE OPTION: When you bring the BedStory mattress to a campout, it serves two purposes. When laid out, it creates a plush sleeping surface. When folded up, it creates a couch, great for relaxing before you head off to bed. Each of the 3 mattress pads unzip for easy washing. Each end also has a handle to more easily move the mattress. SUPPORTIVE & DURABLE: Made from 100% high-density foam, the BedStory Tri-fold Foam Folding Mattress is incredibly comfortable and versatile for those who like a firm bed. Its 4” thickness and firm feel fully protect you from the ground beneath, making it a solid choice for use in tents or on hardwood floors. CertiPUR-US Certified: BedStory is committed to the safety and health of their customers. Their memory foam mattress is made using CertiPUR-US certified foams, guaranteeing that the foams have met strict criteria that protect human health. REMOVABLE COVER & MACHINE WASHABLE: Using hypoallergenic knitted cover, this trifold mattress is skin-friendly and free of harmful materials, which is suitable for all ages. When the cover needs to be cleaned, it can be removed easily with the zipper design, and the durable material is machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zgL496b1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BedStory","source_asin":"B0BN3V7FDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN3V7FDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN3V7FDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":640947,"name":"MaMix Salad Lunch Container To Go, 68-oz Large Salad Bowls with 4 Compartments,2pcs Sauce Cups, Salad Dressings Container for Salad Toppings, Snacks (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WMB6+cjHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Salad Container for Lunch - Spacious 68-oz salad bowl to go – fits up to 6 cups of healthy fruits and vegetables (without the tray or 8.5 cups when using the tray) for easy portioning.It’s big enough to hold all your salad addition and to be able to mix your dressing. Safe Materials - MaMix salad lunch containers are made of food-grade materials,BPA free,Safe and durable.and in fashionable appearance.Great size to make a large salad for work lunches ,picnic, travel. 4-Compartment Tray- Our salad lunch bowls for adults,It comes with 2 3oz containers which is nice for you to store your vitamins in as well. The compartment up top are great for tomatoes, cucumbers, and other things that wouldale salad watery sitting in the fridge. Leak-proof design: The lid of salad lunch container is equipped with tight locks sealing up tighter than those with rubber rim.The sealing silicone ring built into the lid prevents food from leaking and keeps the food fresh. You can put it in a backpack or bag. If you get tired of sandwiches for work and like salads as much as I do, then this is for you.Most of the salad containers were small and just one piece.The container is seals tightly and there is no improvement you would make to eat.Put your lettuce in the bottom, fixins in the top and put in refrigerator or ice chest and your good to go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WMB6+cjHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MaMix","source_asin":"B09YKZK7PB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YKZK7PB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YKZK7PB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
