window.products.push({"id":640988,"name":"Kilner Facetted Clip Top Glassware Jar, Airtight Seal for Pickling, Preserving, and Storing, 74-1/2-Fluid Ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fmbTEFw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An icon of the Kilner family, the Facetted Clip Top Glassware Jar features a distinct, rustic design reminiscent of a bygone era. Its signature, airtight clip-top lid keeps food fresher, longer; from sauces and preserves to dry mixes and snacks. Kilner's high-quality glass jars are durable, non-toxic, and non-porous, defining a versatile container as attractive as it is useful. The Kilner Facetted Clip Top Glassware Jar measures 6-inches long by 4-3/4-inches wide by 12-7/8-inches high with a capacity of 74-1/2-fluid ounces. The Kilner business was first established by John Kilner in the 1840's in England. Initially producing glass bottles and jars, it was towards the end of the 19th century when the original Kilner Jar was first invented. The original Kilner jar is as much-loved and successful now as it was 120 years ago. Its long-lasting popularity is owed to its distinctive pressure seal and iconic design. Put simply, households all over the world trust it to successfully preserve and pickle their fruit and vegetables. Now, not only is the Kilner jar an essential for the kitchen but has become a statement of style around the home and office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fmbTEFw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kilner","source_asin":"B08ZYK381K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-640988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYK381K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYK381K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
